WEBVTT

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.890
We'll be taking the princess.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:07.940
Princess!

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:08.360
Ann!

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.360
Regina!

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.720
Mana...

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.830
Let's go.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.170
Your father is waiting.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.070
Regina!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:33.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.600
Every day it sparkles

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.300
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:51.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.470
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:07.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:13.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:22.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:32.210
What's more than just cute

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:36.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:42.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:48.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:55.000
Cheers!

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:01.330
There's nothing like the sweet taste of victory!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.720
Once you're out of the picture,

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:08.040
it'll <i>really</i> be curtains for Trump Kingdom!

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:12.210
You'll finally be awoken, and yet we'll part just after...

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:13.910
It's such a shame!

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:16.400
I've been bustin' my butt the most around here,

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.340
so I'm gonna get the credit.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:21.820
Bel and Mammo are gonna be my lackeys!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.030
Speakin' of which...

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:29.840
Why's she still a popsicle?

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.990
We can't get to her like this.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.940
Then let's get smashin'.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.550
It's haaaaaaard. {Shaking subs pls?}

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.570
Simpleton tricks won't work.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.750
H-Hey, that's over the top!

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.040
Let go!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.420
You let go! Just let go already...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.470
Enjoy.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:08.170
Seems we've no choice but to take her to your father.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:09.910
Yeah...

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.030
<i>Regina!</i>

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.490
Oh? Something wrong?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.450
Nothing!

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.560
Is that so? To me...

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.220
you looked like you were thinking about someone else.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.350
No I wasn't!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.630
I wasn't...

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:40.140
To Trump Kingdom!

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:40.140
To Trump Kingdom!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.770
Mister, where are you...

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.130
To Trump Kingdom.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.760
I'm certain Ann was taken to King Selfish.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.250
We don't have a moment to lose!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.260
But we don't have a way to get there...

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.430
We're stuck...

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.830
Don't you worry!

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.780
Just stay positive!

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.340
It'll work out somehow!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.840
The Royal Crystals!

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:37.210
Could that be...

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.430
Should we enter it? {Oh hey, it worked out somehow. Good going, Lance.}

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.060
The crystals have shown us the way this whole time!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.740
They must be doing that now!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.010
Let's go!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:51.580
Allow me to look after Ai.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:52.970
I wish you luck.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.350
<i>We'll definitely find...</i>

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.880
<i>the princess...</i>

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.030
<i>Ann...</i>

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.240
<i>and take her back!</i>

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.100
<i>And I'll have a heart-to-heart with Regina!</i>

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:13.360
Charles!

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:17.290
Precure Love Link!

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.100
L-O-V-E!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:19.840
L-O-V-E!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.510
L-O-V-E!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.600
L-O-V-E!

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.460
Brimming with love,

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.680
Cure Heart!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.860
The light of wisdom,

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.130
Cure Diamond!

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.480
The warmth of the sun,

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.770
Cure Rosetta!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.480
The blade of courage,

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.810
Cure Sword!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:15.480
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.220
Dokidoki Precure!

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.560
King Selfish,

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.800
we have brought the princess of Trump Kingdom.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.720
WHAT TOOK YOU?!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.550
We are deeply sorry!

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:46.380
Still, Regina,

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.490
I must commend you.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.090
You've made your father proud!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.560
Thank you, Daddy.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:57.070
Bring the princess.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.530
Once you are eradicated,

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.740
there will be none left to stop me!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:28.730
You yet resist in your pitiful state?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.930
Regardless, the princess is ours.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:37.380
For now, let us turn everyone in the human world into a Selfish.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.540
Huh?!

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:43.190
You're going to do to the human world what you did to Trump Kingdom?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.170
Naturally.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:49.720
But you don't need to if you just want Daddy to move again...

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.180
Fool!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:56.520
Trump Kingdom and the human world are but mere appetizers!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.810
The main course is the universe!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:03.670
I shall make all Egogy in the universe mine!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:06.710
You awe me, King Selfish.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.460
<i>No...</i>

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:15.510
You've been unlike yourself for some time, Regina.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.870
We are selfish.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:21.750
The fate of the human world is not our concern.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.390
Should King Selfish take the gloves off,

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:29.180
neither the human world nor the Precures would survive.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:36.070
Won't you be glad to say your goodbyes to those pests?

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.860
Why... won't it stop?

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:50.680
Those love-spreading Precures can just disappear.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.310
You can't!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.920
Daddy, don't hurt the human world!

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.860
What'd you say?

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:08.510
Opposing the will of King Selfish is indeed bold!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.670
Now, apologize immediately, and...

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.640
Far too late!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:15.660
Who do you think you utter your nonsense to?

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.470
But—

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:18.150
Silence!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:21.760
You are no longer any daughter of mine!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.510
A Selfish worrying about a human?

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.530
She turned into quite the fool.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.210
Now be gone from my sight!

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:53.150
Leave the cleanup to me.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.170
The heck? A bird?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.320
A meteor? {alt. "A plane?"}

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.280
No...

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:13.560
it's the Precures! {This is the best }

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.640
Why did it happen like <i>this</i>?!

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.940
Is everyone all right?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.220
Somehow...

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:31.480
We've finally reached Trump Kingdom.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:34.190
Our battle begins now.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.870
The princess must be there!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.870
Let's hurry...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.480
Not happenin'.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:47.070
You had to come all the way to Trump Kingdom?

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.070
You brats really are a pain.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:52.270
Perhaps you have a death wish?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:55.240
Our plans are nothing of the sort!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:58.040
Those piercing, fiery eyes...

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.000
<i>really</i> irritate me!

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.790
Get them!

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.020
Selfish!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:19.340
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.530
Diamond!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.430
We'll hold these enemies off!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.210
Go ahead to the princess!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.540
There's no time for second guessing!

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.580
We'll follow you shortly!

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.760
<i>Truly</i> irritating!

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:54.440
My lady, if you need a dance partner, I'll satisfy you.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.420
Stop getting in our way!

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.910
We could say the same to you!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:09.960
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:15.980
Now!

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.610
Save Ann!

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:18.550
Right!

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:26.150
Those two really are useless.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.930
No matter.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:33.600
Those despicable Precures are always spouting their love and friendship drivel.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.860
If it means that much to them,

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:37.890
they can die in the name of love.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:17.730
Regina! {aaaand we're back.}

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.360
What happened?

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.210
Stay strong!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.190
Cure... Heart...

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.060
Good...

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:37.340
Sel...

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:38.830
fish!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.070
Magma?

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.550
Fly to the surface ahead of me!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.380
Sure!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.520
I can't!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.990
My powers must be sealed!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.960
How careless.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.460
Why you...

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.280
It's showtime!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:11.540
Take a look, Precures!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.800
Cure Heart!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.040
Regina is with her as well!

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.710
How did that happen?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.650
We'll climb up in a flash.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:19.940
I've got this!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.250
You sure you should move so much?

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.280
The thread's going to snap!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.360
Stop!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.230
Okay!

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.430
You two are hanging by a lone thread!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.860
That thread is made by this Spider Selfish.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.110
It can only handle the weight of one person.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:51.070
Meaning it's impossible for the both of you to survive.

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:57.280
But it won't end that way if one of you falls into the magma.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.410
There's no way I'd ever do that!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.310
Your concern for others is your undoing.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.890
You always put others first, allowing me to set this simple trap.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:13.560
There really is nothing better than being selfish!

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:14.560
You're wrong!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:18.530
You can't be happy if you can't trust others!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:32.740
<i>If I can show them how useless their love is by having them both fall into the magma, then that's fine too.{*≪２人なかよくマグマに落ちて 愛など何の役にも立たないことを
証明してくれれば　それで結構≫}</i>

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:37.360
<i>Even on the off chance that Regina sacrifices Cure Heart,</i>

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.720
<i>I can just cut the thread.</i>

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:44.490
<i>And once I do, I'll definitely be the #2 Selfish!</i>

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.580
<i>And one day...</i>

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.360
Hey, Mana,

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.490
what are we... to each other?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.620
We're friends.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:12.100
<i>Sure.</i>

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.390
<i>Let's be friends.</i>

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.180
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.060
<i>You're already our friend.</i>

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.880
<i>Because we're all friends!</i>

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:20.540
<i>You and everyone else!</i>

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:26.940
Mana... you never change.

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:28.230
Hm?

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.700
It's like...

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.890
something's been wrong with me since I met you.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:38.430
When you were nice to me, my heart started to race.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:44.900
And when you looked sad, my heart started to clench.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:49.960
What do these feelings mean?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.580
It means you sympathize with others.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.270
It's love. {Rikka confirmed for being NTRed}

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:56.980
Love...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.000
maybe... it is.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:06.640
Mana, I love you! {;_____;}

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.830
Regina!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.200
What?!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.290
You can't give up!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.210
But...

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.490
No ifs, ands, or buts!

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:50.250
We're not at the end of our rope!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.260
Who the heck do you think I am?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:58.390
I'm Oogai First Middle School's Student Council President!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.430
Huh?!

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.260
Does that mean a lot?

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.570
You bet it does!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:06.820
When the student council fights for someone's smile,

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.840
we can be even stronger than your dad!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.860
That's right!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.840
Mana's the strongest in the universe!

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:14.690
That's nonsense!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.210
Just fall already!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.410
I refuse!

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.100
Don't worry.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.560
If the thread snaps, we'll climb the wall!

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:25.460
And if the wall crumbles, we'll figure something else out!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.890
Mana...

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.040
The two of us can do it!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.460
Make that three!

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.360
Oh, sorry.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:35.180
Yeah!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:38.830
What?

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.770
Is she...

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.320
<i>Why is it...</i>

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:47.990
<i>that my heart...</i>

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.340
<i>won't stop...</i>

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.310
<i>pounding?</i>

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:58.150
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.000
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:01.620
Way to go, pops.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.810
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.990
You really are useless.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:05.840
Every day it sparkles

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:06.150
Spider Selfish!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:09.480
Dokidoki Precure

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.090
Eliminate Regina!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.460
Seeeelfish!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:16.670
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.630
Selfish!

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:18.530
Now that my powers are back, I'm unstoppable!

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:21.930
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:22.740
Seeeelf...

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:27.910
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.460
iiiiiish!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.380
We've got no choice.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.060
Destroy them all at once!

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:33.430
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:38.780
If your friends are in trouble

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.670
We'll fight all at once, too!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.700
Love Heart Arrow!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:47.410
isn't it normal to help them?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.620
Happy lucky Precure

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:53.270
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.740
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.670
Our happy love will change the world

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.460
What's more than just cute

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.080
is our promise between girls

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:07.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:13.490
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.320
Love love loooove!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.000
I'll be taking Ann back!

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:24.780
Get back to the gate!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.510
Okay!

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:26.880
What should I...

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:29.340
Regina!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.480
Daddy!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:32.680
Curse you!

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.400
You not only oppose my authority,

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.880
but you befriended those Precures!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.770
Are you all right?

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:46.630
Yeah...

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:47.930
Let us hurry!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.520
Let's go.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:07.750
Reginaaaa!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:13.430
This way!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:20.660
You shall not escape!

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:33.500
Precures!

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:37.300
We made it!

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:38.980
We won!

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:40.950
Princess...

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:47.410
This is... good, right?

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:05.010
{ED}

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:09.240
We won't let you have Regina!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:11.810
No matter how much you hurt and wound us,

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:13.740
We've already sworn to protect her!

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:17.110
That's why we absolutely will not lose!

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.950
Mana and the others are fighting for me...

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:21.590
I love my daddy,

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:24.120
but I love Mana and the others too!

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:25.990
I want to be friends forever!

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.060
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:31.600
Arriving In The Nick Of Time! 

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:31.600
Arriving In The Nick Of Time! 

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:34.100
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
